		// and a highest label of 217, framemap 1304 has 81 and 90.
		//
		// No crouch was adopted: GoblinIdle (6203) really is a squat but is goblin-
		// skeleton frame data, and HUMAN_CRATE_SQUAT (9406) is prop-specific and not a
